# Item 1.11e, the measurement alone (kernel/programs/src/bin/wake-measure.rs): the time from a
# wake to the woken thread's run, on a quiet machine, with every CPU computing and with every
# CPU but one computing. Booted by itself with 4 CPUs, so nothing else runs beside it; not
# part of the CI boot, and it judges nothing.
moruna-image 1
process wake-measure
  handle console console
  expect wake-measure: done
  exits 0
